**See also:** [GE-20260422-e48245](GE-20260422-e48245.md) — @DefaultBean lives in io.quarkus.arc, not jakarta.enterprise.inject

**See also:** [GE-20260601-fcf0d9](GE-20260601-fcf0d9.md) — two @DefaultBean beans for the same type → AmbiguousResolutionException

